= Acknowledgments

// AUTHOR NOTE
// ----------------------------------------------------------------
// Funding-source acknowledgement is required by some sponsors,
// including Department of Defense (DoD) basic-research awards, and
// is occasionally required by AIAA reviewers when the work was
